{"kind":"sentence","lang":"zh-hant","entities":{"8928623":{"renderings":[{"id":"981e4ef25b47d48a","lang":"zh","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13603203"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"肚子痛。是不是西瓜吃太多了？","direction":"fromJapanese"}]},"10806994":{"renderings":[{"id":"e13912a81ec7824b","role":"translation","source":{"source":"tatoeba-cmn","ref":"13949337"},"match":"id","status":"imported","value":"「媽，冰箱裡的『醬油漬菇』看起來很好吃欸。可以吃嗎？」「吃是可以，但吃了好像會肚子痛，要小心喔。」「啊？誰做的啊？」「啊，那個是阿公去山上採的野菇，阿嬤拿去醃的啦。」「那裡面該不會混進了不能吃的毒菇吧？」「是這樣嗎？」","direction":"fromJapanese"}]}}}